        "created_at": "2015-06-25T18:25:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unless you immediately follow that rampage with unleashing the birds back at Matriarch, you'll probably lose Savage Mana to an ongoing wipe. She powers through her deck with fowls there or not.</p>",
