        "created_at": "2015-06-26T12:57:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is one thing to watch out for with Lilian, true. It's a matter of hoping the group as a whole can get out enough spare ongoings to be able to ditch them when Cacophonies start coming out so that you don't have to give up Savage Mana and give all the birdies and stuff back.</p><p>Unforgiving Wasteland is the best, though of course :D.</p>",
